"note_claim": "These low budget mascot costumes are worn by scammers who solicit money for photos, usually in New York.",
"label": "SUPPORTS",
"quote": "Unlicensed and unpaid, these stand-ins for Deadpool, Spongebob Squarepants and the like subsist on tips from posing for photos.",
"reason": "The article confirms that unlicensed costumed performers in Times Square, New York, solicit tips for photos and are not official employees."
